  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You bind an elemental of CR 10 or less into a tree or large plant within range. The bound elemental sustains and animates the plant, turning it into a Bound Grove Elemental. The tree moves at 20 ft, has the elemental's hit points, and can use all of the elemental's actions. The elemental cannot leave the plant form for the spell's duration. The tree resists fire damage equal to half its elemental's original elemental immunity.</p>",
